  (text "POWER PATH (rev A): battery -> Holybro PM02 (current sense) -> J1 XT60 -> ESC bus.\nESC bus -> M1..M4 ESC pads, P1/P2 (FC VBAT) -> FC VBAT pads.\nC1: low-ESR. Signal GND only meets GND_ESC through the FC."
    (at 25.4 25.4 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
    (uuid 1d83b164-f9d3-4c4f-b825-39df193b9526)
  )
  (text "ESC signal headers: pin 2 (ESC BEC +5V) is left unconnected,\nso the ESC plugs fit unmodified without back-feeding the FC's servo rail.\nJ3 is wired to the FC's S1-S4 and G pads.\nJ5-J10: GPS, RX and PM02 sockets, each with a pad row for a lead to the FC.\nTX/RX are named from the FC side. PM02 VCC (J9 pins 1-2) is not connected."
    (at 165.1 25.4 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
    (uuid 5a860845-a42e-4b9a-8460-6a6443e06f1a)
  )
  (text "Mechanical: H1-H4 frame standoffs 44mm M3, H5-H8 FC 30.5mm M3,\nZT1-ZT8 zip-tie slots for ESC lead strain relief."
    (at 25.4 152.4 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
    (uuid a93adf70-369e-45bb-9e9f-5a305d60cff9)
  )

